title: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › Mark OK or decline
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId?ref=RF-2048
intro: Two ways to decide a referral without waiting for the referrer. 'Mark OK' accepts one finding with a written reason. 'Decline' closes the referral with a reason, and can be undone with 'Reopen referral'.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Mark OK' on a checklist row"
start s2 "Full page, Validation tab:\nResolve › 'Mark OK with reason'"
start s3 "Click 'Decline'\nChecklist, or the full page header\nStays available while 'Accept' is disabled"

group gOk "Mark OK"
  overlay o1 "'Mark OK with a reason'\nSubtitle: the check, e.g. 'Clinician signature is present'\n'Reader found: The signature line is empty. Reader cannot confirm who ordered this.'"
  input i1 "Type a 'Reason' (required)\nHint 'Logged with your name on the activity timeline.'\nPlaceholder 'Why is it fine to go ahead?'"
  decision d1 "At least 5 characters?"
  process p1 "'Mark OK' stays disabled"
  click c1 "Click 'Mark OK'"
  store st1 "Finding is marked resolved with your reason\nThe source document itself does not change"
  process p2 "Timeline 'You overrode: Clinician signature is present' with the reason"
  toast t1 "'Marked OK'\n'Your reason is on the activity timeline.'"
  screen sc1 "Row turns Done\n'Marked OK by Jordan Perez: …'\nProgress goes up by one; Validation tab shows pill 'Marked OK'\nA required row no longer blocks 'Accept referral and continue'"
endgroup
click cX1 "Click 'Cancel' or 'Close', press Escape,\nor click outside the dialog"
endx e1 "Nothing changes"

group gDec "Decline"
  overlay o2 "'Decline RF-2048?'\n'The reason goes on the activity timeline. You can reopen a declined referral later.'"
  process p3 "'Reason' starts as the likely one\nOutside age range if age failed; Coverage cannot be confirmed if coverage lapsed;\nClinical criteria not met if a check failed; else Needs a higher level of care"
  input i2 "Pick a 'Reason'\nOutside age range, Outside service area, Needs a higher level of care, No bed available, Coverage cannot be confirmed, Clinical criteria not met, Referrer withdrew"
  input i3 "Type a 'Note' (optional)\n'Only your team sees this.'"
  input i4 "Switch 'Send a courtesy reply to the referrer (by fax)'\nOn to start with"
  click c2 "Click 'Decline referral'"
  store st2 "Referral is Declined\nReason, note and courtesy choice saved\nTimeline 'Declined: Needs a higher level of care'"
  decision d2 "Courtesy reply on?"
  ext x1 "Referrer gets a courtesy reply by fax, email or e-referral\n(demo: simulated)"
  process p4 "Timeline 'Courtesy reply sent to Dr. Lindqvist, Family Medicine by fax'"
  toast t2 "'Declined: Needs a higher level of care'\n'1 referral. Courtesy replies were sent.'"
  screen sc2 "Checklist after declining\nRed banner 'Declined: …'\nMain button is 'Reopen referral'; no Accept, no Decline"
endgroup
click cX2 "Click 'Cancel' or 'Close', press Escape,\nor click outside the dialog"
endx e2 "Nothing changes"

group gRe "Undo"
  click c3 "Click 'Reopen referral'\nChecklist, header, or 'Reopen' on the red banner"
  store st3 "Referral is In review again\nDecline cleared; timeline 'You reopened the referral'"
  toast t3 "'Referral reopened'\n'RF-2048 is back In review.'"
endgroup

s1 --> o1
s2 --> o1
o1 --> i1 --> d1
d1 -->|No| p1 --> cX1
d1 -->|Yes| c1 --> st1 --> p2 --> t1 --> sc1
o1 --> cX1 --> e1

s3 --> o2 --> p3 --> i2 --> i3 --> i4 --> c2 --> st2 --> d2
d2 -->|Yes| x1 --> p4 --> t2
d2 -->|No| t2
t2 --> sc2 --> c3 --> st3 --> t3
o2 --> cX2 --> e2
